  "name": "eggplant",
  "description": "Eggplant is a low-level 3D graphics engine prototype implemented in an early dialect of Rust. It provides a core framework for geometry processing through a Wavefront OBJ loader and a structured mesh representation layer. The system includes a hierarchical scene graph architecture for managing and rendering complex object relationships via OpenGL bindings.",
